[12.132127, "o", "watch.json object:\r\n  seen  — integer gather word the mill stored\r\n"]
[12.132669, "o", "  bag   — basename of the bag path\r\n  note  — same basename\r\n\r\nThe gather word for a published bag is the wait-board integer the gatherer publishes after it reads the bag.\r\nThat integer is not the bag's first-line token alone.\r\nA first line of 0 means the gatherer never publishes.\r\nShipped sample bags: `/app/hopbags/elm.bag`, `/app/hopbags/mute.bag`. Grade-time bags may appear as `/app/hopbags/held.bag`, `/app/hopbags/held2.bag`, `/app/hopbags/side.bag`.\r\n"]
[12.132883, "o", "/app/opslip/NOTES.txt\r\n"]
[12.133664, "o", "--- /app/opslip/NOTES.txt\r\n"]
[12.134889, "o", "Draft mill finishes on the same bags the ship mill leaves at 0.\r\nShip hangs or returns the opening zero while kindle still exits 0.\r\nA nap helper lives under softmill from an old hang drill; it is unused by the packed mill.\r\n"]
[12.13548, "o", "/app/opslip/VERBS.txt\r\n"]
[12.136146, "o", "--- /app/opslip/VERBS.txt\r\n"]
